---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Timeline } from "@/components/Timeline";
---

<Layout title="About Me | Daniel's Portfolio">
    <main class="flex flex-col items-center px-6 py-12 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
        <div class="w-full max-w-5xl space-y-8">
            <section class="w-full">
                <h1
                    class="bg-linear-to-r from-foreground via-foreground/90 to-muted-foreground bg-clip-text text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6"
                >
                    About Me
                </h1>
                <div
                    class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"
                >
                    <p>
                        Front-End Developer focused on building high-performance
                        React and Next.js applications, interactive WebGIS
                        platforms, and complex state management in data-heavy
                        environments.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        My career path was shaped by independent learning and
                        tackling real-world challenges head-on. At Map.ir,
                        shortly after joining the team, I took on sole
                        responsibility for the front-end development of
                        large-scale projects like the National Post Company's
                        public portal (Sina) and their dedicated internal
                        dashboard (GNAF). Handling these projects from start to
                        finish taught me how to navigate complex architectures
                        and drive development independently while maintaining
                        high standards.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        As the team grew, I mentored junior developers and
                        simultaneously worked on implementing Offline-first and
                        PWA architectures to ensure seamless application
                        performance in specialized, low-connectivity
                        environments.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        My approach to programming is fundamentally about
                        problem-solving. Whether it involves engineering a heavy
                        browser-based feature or learning a new tool to optimize
                        a workflow, I am always ready to combine technical
                        expertise with curiosity to deliver the best possible
                        solution.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <Timeline client:visible />
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
